WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.323
Welcome to China Toy Atlas.

00:00:02.323 --> 00:00:05.559
Find Chinese blind boxes, squishies and character toys.

00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:08.391
Start with a brand, shop or character.

00:00:08.391 --> 00:00:10.818
Tap a product photo for details.

00:00:10.818 --> 00:00:12.841
This guide is still growing.

00:00:12.841 --> 00:00:18.100
Its product counts describe what we have collected, not everything a retailer sells.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.687
Open Retail chains and tap Top Toy.

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.904
Its captured shop catalog opens immediately.

00:00:23.904 --> 00:00:26.860
There is no second product link to choose.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.186
These are international store listings, with that market's prices.

00:00:30.186 --> 00:00:33.143
Other retailers may have only a partial listing.

00:00:33.143 --> 00:00:39.425
A small count means our research is incomplete, not that the shop sells only a few toys.

00:00:40.425 --> 00:00:44.698
Use Brand, Product type and the search box to narrow your choices.

00:00:44.698 --> 00:00:48.972
Here we select Pop Mart and search for Cry Me An Ocean.

00:00:48.972 --> 00:00:50.753
Reset filters returns to browsing.

00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:53.602
Use the Brands page to explore more makers.

00:00:53.602 --> 00:00:57.875
A character name and the company that makes it are different things.

00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:00.316
Tap Full product details.

00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:03.558
Check the character, size, material and the pictured design.

00:01:03.558 --> 00:01:10.764
Open the shop options to see whether an offer is one random box, a full set, or a confirmed character.

00:01:10.764 --> 00:01:13.646
Keep the shop, country and currency in mind.

00:01:13.646 --> 00:01:15.808
A launch price can be historical.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:19.050
Follow the shop link for today's price and availability.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:23.600
Select two to six products, then open Compare.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.369
The table places their photographs, prices, packs and available facts side by side.

00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:32.031
Compare the same pack and currency.

00:01:32.031 --> 00:01:35.137
Different character options can have different prices.

00:01:35.137 --> 00:01:37.800
Blank information means unconfirmed, not zero.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.654
The bookmark saves favourites on this browser.

00:01:41.654 --> 00:01:44.508
Open Saved favourites to see them again.

00:01:44.508 --> 00:01:47.362
Download CSV exports the current filtered list.

00:01:47.362 --> 00:01:54.700
In Compare, Download comparison CSV saves your selected products, and Download photo sheet gives you an illustrated file.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.554
CSV contains photo links, not embedded images.

00:01:57.554 --> 00:02:00.000
You can open CSV in Excel.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:05.036
This week shows the saved catalog period and latest source update.

00:02:05.036 --> 00:02:07.238
Expand it for changes and sources.

00:02:07.238 --> 00:02:11.642
Added to this guide does not necessarily mean a new product launch.

00:02:11.642 --> 00:02:14.944
Trending can mean reported demand or a shop's recommendation.

00:02:14.944 --> 00:02:18.247
Open the evidence to check the date and market.

00:02:18.247 --> 00:02:22.650
These signals do not automatically establish nationwide rankings or weekly sales growth.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:28.757
Music and click sounds begin after your first tap, when your browser allows audio.

00:02:28.757 --> 00:02:30.581
Choose Soft, Medium or Lively.

00:02:30.581 --> 00:02:35.324
Use Sound on to mute, and tap Sound off to enable it again.

00:02:35.324 --> 00:02:36.783
Your preference is remembered.

00:02:36.783 --> 00:02:39.337
Brands and Research also have these controls.

00:02:39.337 --> 00:02:43.350
Music pauses during the tutorial so you can hear the narration.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:49.243
Some shops have many captured products, while others have a small researched sample.

00:02:49.243 --> 00:02:51.125
Partial listing marks this difference.

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:54.889
China release highlights are separate from an international shop catalog.

00:02:54.889 --> 00:02:57.147
The coverage notes explain remaining gaps.

00:02:57.147 --> 00:03:04.675
Check the original seller before buying, and use the dates shown to judge how recent each price or release is.
